ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH=pbkdf2-sha256$10000$71b553b223ded9f45733d7e94f3e9dd3$40e70d184d928ee730fbbb5e80701d146fa48e857698a69886b727b60aba5d6f
SIGNING_SECRET=dev-signing-secret-at-least-32-chars!!
